CHANGELOG
=========

v0.1.1 (2026-09-05):
	Fixes:

	* After adding a dependency on 'html2text' and updating to Quicklisp
	  v2026-01-01, some transitive dependencies could not be resolved, and were
	  not bundled into the release package. This rendered the v0.1.0 release
	  tarball impossible to build by package managers. Include the dependencies
	  missing from v0.1.0 in the release package.

v0.1.0 (2026-08-23):
	Fixes:

	* Switch from the deactivated Jira "/rest/api/2/search" API to
	  "/rest/api/3/search/jql".

	Changes:

	* Print Jira API errors on the console.

v0.0.1 (2022-05-22):
	First release.

